    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854150/extras/3bb8ee141052710185fc90fb263f8450.poster.avif?t=1751935021\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854150/extras/3bb8ee141052710185fc90fb263f8450.webm?t=1751935021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854150/extras/3bb8ee141052710185fc90fb263f8450.mp4?t=1751935021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REDACT</strong>\u00a0is a <i>short</i> indie game, where listening or not affects the path of your gameplay and story.<br>A singular button that can do so many things with a power of a cassette (and maybe a robot?)<br>Choices that can also affect your outcome of the game! Set in the 1980s</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854150/extras/67374fcfc8d00c1e4c836af16a8111c5.poster.avif?t=1751935021\" width=800 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854150/extras/67374fcfc8d00c1e4c836af16a8111c5.webm?t=1751935021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854150/extras/67374fcfc8d00c1e4c836af16a8111c5.mp4?t=1751935021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To expect; the game is short, and some replay value. I will be bug-fixing the game and polishing more off when needed and reported. This project is more of a personal project, so the game isn't meant to be taken seriously, so I recommended before playing this game.<br>To not have high expectations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854150/extras/30b928f44de9148097cd1f01b6f431d6.poster.avif?t=1751935021\" width=800 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854150/extras/30b928f44de9148097cd1f01b6f431d6.webm?t=1751935021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854150/extras/30b928f44de9148097cd1f01b6f431d6.mp4?t=1751935021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features;</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun Narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive Elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a robot friend!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now what  ending(s) or choices are you gonna make?</p>",
